{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1485,
  "batch_count": 1652,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "33cae8524551c593c4a9016580345724140f0481",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f6fe1fc0f62efdcaebda0da",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "家に帰れば家族と即セッション。\r\nご近所さんも巻き込んで、\r\n日が暮れるまでアンサンブルさ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c32a719a8581b842c67e2dfc95701882cb015487b2c37f041f2047f5f10859a0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1232478633ef31214c660f2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ライブは生き物。\r\n時に五線譜を飛び出して、\r\n無限の音と戯れるのさ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "97d4c7584ebd98713bee550ba5e3657616cc3148ac09d2a8b06a918262ad92d8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:709ba8404cc73064564b639c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "同じ楽曲でも、表情はその時々。\r\n何度も奏で、語り合う。\r\nそうして魂に刻まれるのさ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "80e7993a1ad598c5baaba6b296cef2e07ae5d29912e73627f5dd21abceb650ac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fbaec69ab5cd23d59ff7bbbb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "このブローチには、愛すべき\r\nムジカの源をあしらっている。\r\n彩り豊かな星…地球さ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b5776f3d4ab2b1fa32c5204a97cfac1a555ea6f25f97fab98a6b9df73180c36c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:160d92d1a96d00bafb101d1b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ターフに立つときは、いつだって\r\nこのスコアと同じ気分さ。\r\nタタタタラタタンタターーーン♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "638f23fccbff9f5764fdbbec9568cfd8b36690165c57b06c7abc8284795ec946",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d48099a788bf9151099be8dc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "私も楽器の一部だからね。\r\n牛乳、指の体操、そして唇の\r\nフラッピングで1日を始めるのさ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a413b5f09fe01234c8c873d909a7453491746b4def2727e9606788ff1a3f795b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9c44c17405477b1224a358b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "朗らかな午後のひと時に、\r\nアダージョな演奏会でもどうかな？\r\n君だけに贈る…特別公演だよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b8fcf3654f86c0100c9bff35a5942018fc449df8c2ae7895d520355ddeef520",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:af586dc59b4b5fee7358e2fc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "もうこんな時間か。まだまだ\r\n君の音と触れ合いたかったけど…\r\n続きは夢の中だね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d7ccb3696f41d8d3a3431794128289a32ede62fbaac2a15f1f884ffbd8153035",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13833646357f425c6cacd9cd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "緊張している新入生たちに向けて、\r\n演奏会を開くつもりさ。音楽は、\r\n心のドアをノックする魔法だよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "412042e6ccadd8f09afc3d2adc3320ba195cd6744b8857735c3cdfb64bd4de13",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35ba916bec19e07b45a7768d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ヴァイオリンは乾燥に弱くてね。\r\nエアコンは厳禁、加湿器はオン。\r\n音色のご機嫌取りは繊細なのさ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5fca0745f15ed8c961de7cc5eb92cb81a996d9fda3562a3cace16a9015adc940",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c92baee6ddabd474721181be",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "秋は物悲しい季節だって？\r\nふふっ、私が側にいても、\r\n同じセリフを言えるかな。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b97c7ec4bb78e765e803ca589b8a9b5061ffff2a5c5b1c1aac5f377fa435dedf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0c1461fb340cc96d4f7c71d5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "木枯らしが撫でる度、私の心が\r\nコン・エスプレッシオーネに…。\r\nああ、なんて刺激的な季節なんだ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f584da984149e736768be84cfe4a851b86a1a03e1684d3b9e17cec7849d6890e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b80a04c8e87ee92c8569f2f4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "トレーニングを始める前に、\r\n音合わせから始めようか。\r\nラ～～～～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "6ede7ef3ce9c93835db2acb184c1409a5398f9bb09d571d8f58078eb9a5f50df",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:23747e2b9e9316e526767ee4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "さあ、奏でよう！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f494497f99c17f0251afb3f2bb6b4c3c81de76f1c0134fc4e7649202f933979",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:71bf42a3fb0715f420968575",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "調律に励めば、アポロンは微笑む。\r\nレースも同じ――鍛錬に励む者に、\r\n女神は微笑む！さあ、やろう！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4ffddb592c5422db837c2bb4b1e794aa577159016a21778a3e6d1588707090b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6465741935057b1e2f779fe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "休むも励むもアド・リビトゥム。\r\n思うがまま進もう。\r\nどの道も、ムジカへ至るのさ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a1adea821edcc5d8e736754a8849d076c65579ccf19159c40808058dfe5415ef",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:449277281cf9c0ea4e3b3f3c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "トレーニングとは挑戦の連続。\r\nア・ポコでいい――どんな\r\nエチュードでも始めてみよう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8aee7f72b556ad5ac5c00d412b3b3befc908c02e6a3f49f13983f1157e26fc20",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:76135d65f4a06926a85c1a8c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "エチュードを重ね、\r\n私たちのリズムは揃ってきた。\r\n2人の音が溶け合う日も近そうだ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "59243e36d5b6a824569f020c77e46b58febdc7442865c2208fbb8db385b287ca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9202863a9043cb4b086194b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "いつまでも私の足音を聞いて。\r\nこの先もずっと、ルンガで――\r\n君が望む限り奏でていこう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d42a92aabe0971869bef354c77b6e1dd99d15426540bac9ca59c92ba7cbb450b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce75d79250e2ebc22d8ce218",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "君という優れた調律師が、\r\n私という音に華を添えている。\r\nこのお返しは、アモーレで…ね。",
      "source_fingerprint": "65268b3d549c81d963c5d5fe7f6273e8ff46779954c80de9b276db66b473ad52",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f30dbf1ec17af1d18e3b276f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "夏合宿といえば、ビーチの演奏会。\r\n波や夏虫の調べと手を取り合い、\r\n息の揃ったアッコルドを奏でるのさ",
      "source_fingerprint": "c704960231c891da05cfd3d9d681aaa692f0282f41c62ce35b3784f83161ff06",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b4949de9ef2c003c65d30803",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "君と奏でたアルモニア、深く心に刻んだよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cfe5c5744618c6a6e4c8c078f3cd080524cb9b4173c750329543c2a935fcbc6b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52387a7d39100d49fb9df6fb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ベネ！心地いいフィナーレだ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3e91ba9c0a5742d8ecc5f7a8f31088b4ebf936ae9197b6bb0f97953deacae4fc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b65c8e89112052f81cce960c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感じる、フォルツァートな私の躍動！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bee248d3d27047b8f94a5ec35d24541fe6991369a615cf564d71bc85d2974004",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0443f1c28a8d9b6fba970355",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今、新しいムジカが目覚めたよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e35cfbeb7c837259147dd0720245aa6526dfc279682cb25582e9be782a9013fc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93292f176f01c293c161f792",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "チャオ、サウンズオブアースだよ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "343e734b4015cb6fbb236cfb0815440b27c70dc48d8b1626207e8109ad53a915",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9e5827a3ecce42d5f454690",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "心ゆくまで楽しんでくれ。至高の\r\n音色、情熱のアンサンボゥ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "028809bb1f4986f2d524755c01adb212efe2873f8f291f0cd3839e6d19891d69",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:904e0db7cabbb4a4bdbfd7ae",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "伴奏ならお任せあれ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "414659d20d8d6278c12ebd3c0bd2f2d0688eda2bcc9dbdfccf0ab103a3551934",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:edc6c3b4ba246536fac9d5c0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "まだまだやれるよ～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "9520a7813b5442c334510334d416411147b4e407ccaadc344b29746d022e2dba",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1102",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1deff9ce5302f4168b4f0633",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "貴方いいキャラしてるわね…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf35a38f6dcddff12e5ef3891fab8bb8fc29f2df0c6c4fb31054bf9e69d85876",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1103",
        "20051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4945c982491210ab7e9d97f8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "年越しのカウントダウン。バシッと\r\nキメないとね！『3、2、1…！』\r\nいや『3、2、1っ♪』いやいや…",
      "source_fingerprint": "e2d5feb8ecd4d242262c926482456a6e797c04eda6fb24e18915a371cc71412f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1103",
        "400002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38afdf9eb3c96234e5f62974",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "刺さるものは人それぞれ。つまり…\r\nターゲティングが大事。自分を\r\n曲げるんじゃなく的を絞るのよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3f6a98b5841dc0abfc8380f506cd21d9671d0fe209726271fb483f0704f3a452",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1103",
        "400008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ae76853ababd182895919da",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "さあ今日も爪痕残してくわよ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4beb4cf709c0ef17928e0554f38acc1e9d5d705051498c24a819b090d5338df7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1103",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee65c156a5b01ae484bd121c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "プロデュースとは！こうよっ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "100c73be37f2fdc101ab85c2f1699161db27a2851742f1e07680eb0cac48e6c4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1103",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f2f6be4368e5b597863fb21",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "はっ、こういうのもアリね！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "d40d1f7ca235bdab325fe3ea61ef28c019a80c3579986ec3f3c5c2352cb20978",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1103",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d5d66dcb860e46a0377eb4aa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "尽管上吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8af150512158c10f17b253a8508115348e5a8b75e1756672aed1bd4b1a878783",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83178c514bc3a7a0c5a65724",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我不怕被取笑，被瞧不起也无所谓。\r\n你会陪我一起抓住那\r\n傻得可笑的梦想吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "8616e4d4f6ec80e16653212b3b1f541d12a214476bb8518912a4107c76e407e5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9605137dd94fdad6893c9efe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってくるぜ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f3115702bd0decee3e50903caab119dd6ada22561c0b0ebcebe95c1c183da809",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:596b9ceb44c9b85185bc8908",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ただいま！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d18f79da33c356a433357d86ef63d6f12d0393bf7a401aa168fbc536b2b3d56",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:87b376a64590f6283b33597d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我喜欢你那双过于坚定的眼睛。\r\n我们都一样固执己见，\r\n好好相处吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "803dfb7cec0166ed5b5d3c18844a75d8b3ea3086e1814cd6595d8e838adb228e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:29818f57fec6c21d5adfa272",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要不要去巡视一下田里的状况啊？\r\n嘿嘿，已经完全养成习惯了呢。\r\n……谢谢你啦，训练员。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e0c14787e2e0a9da19b3487971bce2b0ac97de292b95e52550d7b2cf46b977e1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c43fa1da596fddfd0a244053",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新年快乐！所以我们来放风筝吧。\r\n我这「葛城王牌」四个字\r\n可是写得相得不错呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5582a7471429c7cbd5be95b3a838c098a192a6fc8cf9ae5765bb955e163ad75e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e72a8271a1c2f7626bcf657",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赶上了……！准备回礼巧克力真是\r\n忙死我了！我准备了上百份……\r\n一定够我当场回礼给所有人！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a548d2683b7fc68d7db8687e125705d670b1a5f72ecec94a291c6bf0ac49297",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:94bcca5c24a34712150a91e5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "人情……不对，朋友……也不对……\r\n真……心……啊啊──麻烦死了！\r\n我等一下会把同志巧克力送你啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b278dca5af4483ad79da27b931716da9568ebc5104eec32a9bc017f6170e4880",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9c00d11b7d8632b4efb348ba",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "竹子装饰完就丢掉，感觉好浪费啊。\r\n这样吧，我去拿柴刀！待会我们一起\r\n来吃流水素面！好好期待一下吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "750d58b3644219f9a52e5341c61c0b0e91a1b6fce003b7fd48eed7370f216fd4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cfaa9543d75b635a48a631b3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈哈，我劝你还是别捣蛋哦～？\r\n很可惜，我早就准备好点心了！\r\n这些柿饼的滋味可甜了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e2c49bc0bfe8cea33fe3745e126e8bf588574a02e381f2b41d54729ce0a582e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d70299e69f5635b0414a005d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "说到圣诞节就想到日式炸鸡块！\r\n事先用大量酱油腌好的鸡肉\r\n已经在冰箱里等着我啦～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2e87674f48578357c58df29baa44774a851b061902712b7df0f7b999a710e1a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b66aa968aea6e67c24a62cdb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我不知道要送什么礼物才会让\r\n训练员开心，所以直接告诉我吧？\r\n王牌圣诞老公公会实现你的愿望。",
      "source_fingerprint": "61ead8470b7d38b21646257c698a51289398820b1f7d25620f1fbb7cd79a9259",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5254fdc406335b2f43f881f2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好耶！获胜啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e195efae49c3056f3858d6ac54d6477eb2ec2ece965bbf8a6bc5ff8d06b728c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7a15083daeb224f9b80c5f08",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今年也辛苦你啦。至少今天应该会\r\n休假吧？……给～我～休～息～哦？\r\n半夜我们还要去新年参拜耶！",
      "source_fingerprint": "52ef2892827ed5f0e3251c9536d90504e10bde2518c92da381ad1a8a14dbbf8d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a342a98ee3da0d4c4445db7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我买了耳机送你！这还是我第一次\r\n挑选人类用的耳机……但这款应该能\r\n恰到好处地消除噪音，帮助你专心！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f034e3b1ca9ad28ff45e9da923d00f7012587f550613b69739283be72791420",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:edf6386778d1ccc93fcbc79f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日快乐……呃……\r\n啊──那个，虽然外表不太好看，\r\n但我做了个蛋糕……你要吃吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "759417e91c15a2c8171377b5ac91921e1c6681d29055b5dbdabe2648e9e79ec9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:684d6c97f00c25da9bea5f0d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "死党说因为我生日，所以要为我\r\n办场派对耶！我已经事先去跑一跑，\r\n让胃空出来啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f863e32b1a2ba399009705da91987af23fcaabaddc188c1f46a30f6485c43128",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8ce2d1cb09c11dd5175fa3dd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你问我想要什么礼物？\r\n一台专属的农用车吧！……呵，\r\n开玩笑的啦！一起吃美食吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9dcd3b1d55412ffca8a2e6caa40c9cfd1c53dc71769376627303fe9cf3afe59f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d87d5456e3cf252d28bb7d46",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像有新公告哦。\r\n会是什么事呢？\r\n总之去看看就知道啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e8c524a774b8caeef67aaeacda001d829274d137cf2e85df2ad9b668454483fb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa2767b63f0069e1311a90a5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像收到了礼物耶！\r\n太好啦，快去领取吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a568b268b2cf202d99435f43bf582ef822e1b48b992cca02624407fe4a2ab676",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eceba2e6b45ef8982ab7a434",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "完成任务了，辛苦啦！\r\n来，收下奖励吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2505b1e98e1e4e5eaafc89c375d81e417ecf89607747a05259fab4789f5a2256",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ecd5267a2ca5967ef1fbe6a5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好像快要开始举办活动了耶？\r\n你有没有兴趣啊？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c296c9f88d67bd4be5e08030d2bd3039a6bb388d7a6dde467743ad66d50b61ed",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1cb2fbe4e28c0c740858026d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动似乎已经开始举办啰！\r\n好～就由我这个王牌来打头阵吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "31d94d51602faada80e6d319be0da34fc4e940efb3d2f2e8f30d265784b5dadc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e6e7d901e7e0d55a315b2b1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "可恶……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "777b4ad8979359adb6db6b7ac3d8844f696089febbf4880ad99e25d4bcfb7c5c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:38d71fbf1c97223a360d1a2b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛马娘名鉴的等级提升啰！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f59bdf5907a37da4aec86aff55e8a43418b4cbd757c480f5786c04c5eead63c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d1a2c26eb10d99cf5aceb8c8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "スカジャンってのはロマンでよ…\r\nサテンと和柄は伊達と硬派の象徴！\r\nトレーナーさんもそう思わねーか？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a02d89b658f85157fc8e8434a7667bb5145db94622c1b4e81e67b13740aae9ec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eea1b5aed04c0019c7258c7e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "これ着て田舎に帰ると、じいちゃん\r\nばあちゃんが遠くからでも声かけて\r\nくれんだ。手伝ってくれーってな！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5421a32078485012c7c91a0f1fadc6071da2ba65a8efdd9d0201d80ff025d80e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be611820a77890aeade2998b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "じいちゃんちの敷地で、車の練習を\r\nしてたんだ。もう運転できるし、\r\nはやく普通免許も欲しいぜ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "857603bd4b54355c2ea23c383561e60c4551e47626406d0bf3514451ad96c42a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:323609440666e47bf949ea9d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是平手呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c12ac5317481cfc712db8f78b7550685943b2692c3ba858637f37c51a4d9bca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80f8887208c9b45df88e29e7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很好～来抛人庆祝啰──！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2fa92e005699d572cc16fea183d35aeaa78efb7d0b8674baa12110524122a4d1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3810c0382df8b5fb005424ab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "可恶……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "777b4ad8979359adb6db6b7ac3d8844f696089febbf4880ad99e25d4bcfb7c5c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "1005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d2813264cb7292b37760bfaf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是平手呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c12ac5317481cfc712db8f78b7550685943b2692c3ba858637f37c51a4d9bca",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "1006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c9d605716f27b1901e91d871",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "更新高分纪录了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "55b815d8e925a03409f368372177a362f6285ed76f21c3e4bcd289c96d056acd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "1007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7d5bc77ed50a9990210a4ae1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跟着王牌我一起来吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c0812ac62a91614f348bf23be5320cb696980a0d6539c2c41e11ad63e7065ac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "1008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c1951a1065be148c290868d0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "Cygames",
      "source_fingerprint": "70f9f2ba202c631078563014e7f2f960d547e1d0cd4d1c18319f102cf5a87fcb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "11"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:95c55f6d9da8b9f3d1d6aa54",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "特训啊！\r\n也让我加入吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "95663a42af3d1531e393f729208480a43ee1ba56bd6433c467cd5372ae93d781",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "110000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:073323ca96c1d83fbe1b44e2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦～我们彼此都\r\n经历了不少事情呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "df7f9b35f5c362f32bcccb28dee0472e6a19bbca50ce8f05850735266f427b0f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "110001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:adbe5f9496bf70611f077bd3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "要比赛了是吧！\r\n我已经准备得万无一失了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "37e143df3b5a65d660c47e5c430d0d184b7569ae5e3302178617ee0051a9860b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "110002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b678b67a0b6f6d8b35d3c9e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "火热的比赛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7eb5b09a660a936f41e954f49225c76ec7ff13f1bab93d70828fba44bf8b642b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "1173"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83e9a59a94abe99d6fe8bc86",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就让我们来当！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c64ae6fb11c2e434682781152d7a1c141b440fd03db21e532028eeac7281501",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "1174"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee4923da27543ace831824e8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "この背中を！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bc654b777cfb6b6bfefba93bb5e460611b8b24471610f43e9ecdb73165c93d33",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "1183"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:878a52ee2e18d76ec3abfd18",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赛马娘 Pretty Derby！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c68d1ccbe412517d037eba3349a53caf52ee4216f3314987c5d59645520f8f8a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "12"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d16f9e85fa7e8122fee073ec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "涌现出一股惊人的力量……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8dfefdcc60b7b38ba59a24250449e2f62929e7a7b303d137ac175d0a270ccce3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "120000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c0a593c08639de5a70b7dcd6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哦！\r\n这是今天的登录奖励！",
      "source_fingerprint": "883fe464cd82bd04bc5c24d7382e5671f4c9bbf4b64add3c04e59821e98010e8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1104",
        "13"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
